's real  progress being made so I think we need  to take heart from that and we just have  to go with the process and follow it  through whatever it takes for as long as  it takes you know but there's still hope  that we can find Madeline Madeline's  parents say there is still no evidence  that she's been harmed in the absence of  that they have real hope that their  daughter is alive and will one day be  reunited with them Martin brunt Sky News
 

